# Source of truth for the LEGACY helper scripts (public-share → rsync path).
# Prefer DOCKER-MODEL-RUNNER.md for new work. DMR Ansible is disabled until
# commissioned. Add or remove a line only when continuing the legacy pipeline.
# Each line is one model to work with. Echo sections are generated from these
# fields. Scripts only print commands.
# Named .list so it is not hidden by a global *.manifest gitignore.
#
# Restored from 6eab09b6. Do not drop a line because the share folder is
# missing. A missing folder means the Hugging Face paste line still needs
# to be run. It does not mean the model left the working set.
#
# share_rel|hf_repo|gguf_file|ollama_name
# share_rel is the folder under the share models/ directory.
